  "category": "Interventional Pain / Oncology",
  "description": "CMS National Coverage Determination for implantable intrathecal drug delivery systems (NCD 160.18). Requires severe intractable chronic pain of malignant or non-malignant origin, failure of oral or transdermal opioids/adjuvants, and documented response to a preliminary trial injection.",
